---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";

const seo = {
  page_description: "About TrackAndLog: Built for pure metric tracking without the guilt.",
};
---
<Layout seo={seo} title="About | TrackAndLog">
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto py-12 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="prose">
      <h1>About Us</h1>
      <p>TrackAndLog was born out of frustration. Every habit app we tried wanted to guilt-trip us into keeping a streak, gamify our lives with confetti, or lock our personal data behind an expensive subscription.</p>
      <h2>Our Philosophy</h2>
      <p>We believe in pure data. A missed day is just a missed day—it doesn't ruin your long-term trend. We built this tool to let you log a number quickly, see it on a chart, and export it whenever you want.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
